WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:04.440
The eldest has a character that understands the greater good considers the overall situation.

00:04.600 --> 00:07.267
I believe he will prioritize Xuan Kingdom's future.

00:08.160 --> 00:13.480
Now Zu Yue controls the army this can also curb Xu'er's impulsive nature.

00:14.760 --> 00:20.200
With her here xu'er likely won't easily move against the eldest.

00:24.120 --> 00:27.440
Chu Meng call the second son.

00:31.480 --> 00:36.600
Father Father clearly said this wound was almost healed how is this, this.

00:37.280 --> 00:41.347
Your elder brother is benevolent and filial since you have the edict.

00:42.160 --> 00:43.800
He knows it's my intention.

00:44.760 --> 00:47.427
He will never make things difficult for you.

00:49.840 --> 00:53.200
You understand military affairs these years of warfare.

00:54.240 --> 00:57.360
Have given you sufficient prestige in the army.

00:58.960 --> 01:02.120
After you succeed Your mother.

01:02.200 --> 01:07.000
Will make all the noble families submit to you as your support.

01:07.840 --> 01:09.200
I believe.

01:10.640 --> 01:12.440
Xuan Kingdom's future affairs.

01:13.360 --> 01:14.720
You can handle well.

01:17.560 --> 01:19.160
But one thing.

01:21.000 --> 01:22.480
I must warn you.

01:23.560 --> 01:27.160
Remember you are family.

01:28.040 --> 01:32.520
Your son will definitely not become estranged from elder brother.

01:32.600 --> 01:35.120
Those things that make people point fingers.

01:36.320 --> 01:37.680
In your generation.

01:39.480 --> 01:40.840
Don't do them anymore.

01:42.960 --> 01:45.680
Your son will remember.

01:47.880 --> 01:49.280
Rise.

